## License

GE-base use the pretrained weights [ltx-video-2b-v0.9](https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-Video/blob/main/ltx-video-2b-v0.9.safetensors), which means the checkpoint GE_base_fast_v0.1 and GE_base_slow_v0.1 is under [the same license of ltx-video-2b-v0.9](https://huggingface.co/Lightricks/LTX-Video/blob/main/ltx-video-2b-v0.9.license.txt).

